<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten products remain steady.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten products remain steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten product values remained steady on Wednesday but dealers noted good movement this week in gluten feed.</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today	 Prev</p>
